### shiroikuma-termux fork ###
# Release signing: the credentials and the key itself never enter git. (Upstream's own
# app/testkey_untrusted.jks is already tracked, and gitignore never touches a tracked file.)
/keystore.properties
*.jks
# Agent config is committed (CLAUDE.md, .claude/skills/); only the machine-local settings are not.
/.claude/settings.local.json
# Agent working files: generator scripts, intermediate data, throwaway exports.
/.scratch/
